    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But isn't it a given that capital will move to avoid taxes? I've read a lot about how high taxes on wealth basically just cause people to move their money offshore or into non-productive assets. How can a wealth tax be considered \"effective\" if it actually shrinks the total tax base",
